# skill-atlas configuration.
#
# The census needs NO environment variables: every path comes from
# config/roots.json. This file exists for the one optional feature --
# mirroring run history into Grafana. Nothing here is a credential.

# --- optional: Grafana mirror ------------------------------------------------
# When set, `atlas.py build` publishes this run's history to Postgres after the
# report is written. A publish failure is reported as a warning and never fails
# the build: the HTML report is the source of truth, Grafana is a mirror.
#
# DSN for a writer role. The password stays in ~/.pgpass, never here.
# Prefer an untracked grafana/db.env (mode 0600) over exporting this.
# ATLAS_PG_DSN=postgresql://atlas_writer@127.0.0.1:5432/skill_atlas

# Apply grafana/schema.sql once before the first publish. See
# grafana/README.md.
